cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this model or software, please cite it as below."
title: "CHO/FAT Metabolic Pro: estimating carbohydrate and fat oxidation from heart rate and Garmin's energy estimate"
abstract: >-
  Garmin Connect IQ data field and open model that estimate, in real time, the
  oxidation of carbohydrate and fat during exercise. The energy comes from the
  watch's own estimate; it is split between carbohydrate and fat with a
  respiratory exchange ratio estimated from heart rate and the Jeukendrup &
  Wallis (2005) equations.
